From ae6067ace8b498e0a0f3350259365598244cc335 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Date: Fri, 11 Jul 2025 13:57:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 018/105] media: qcom: camss: Add support for PHY API devices

Add the ability to use a PHY pointer which interacts with the standard PHY
API.

In the first instance the code will try to use the new PHY interface. If no
PHYs are present in the DT then the legacy method will be attempted.

Signed-off-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20250711-b4-linux-next-25-03-13-dtsi-x1e80100-camss-v7-4-0bc5da82f526@linaro.org
Signed-off-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
